The structure mirrors [[Part 4.0 - The Escalation Protocol|Cognitive Part 4.0]]: **4.0 is *whether*, 4.2 is *what*, 4.3 is *how*.** This article (Part 5.0) becomes: **which tier matches which learning scenario, with the *what* and *how* delegated to the Cognitive series.**

There are three tiers, mapped directly onto the Cognitive series' three-routine model:

| Tier | Cognitive series source | Learning scenario |
|---|---|---|
| **1 — Daily Baseline** | [[Part 4.1 - The Natural Stack\|Cognitive 4.1]] 🟢 (7d/wk, stimulant-free) | Revision, casual reading, idea capture, low-stakes practice |
| **2 — Heavy Learning Day** | [[Part 4.1 - The Natural Stack\|Cognitive 4.1]] 🧠 overlay (4–5×/wk) | A real focused-learning block: exam prep, deep skill-acquisition, new material |
